{
  "name": "ciallospeed",
  "private": true,
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "type": "module",
  "description": "CialloSpeed — 免费在线中文网速测试，七大测速引擎（Cloudflare × M-Lab NDT7 × OpenSpeedTest × Meter.net × SpeedMeter.dev × LibreSpeed × CDN 直链）交叉验证",
